  ('Programming languages and tech companies', 'adult', 'mc', 'Kotlin, now a first-class language for Android development, was designed and is primarily developed by which software company?', '{"options":["JetBrains","Oracle","Red Hat","Pivotal"],"correctIndex":0}'::jsonb, false, 'ready', '{"verdict":"ready","notes":"Kotlin was created by JetBrains, first released in 2011, and Google announced it as a first-class language for Android in 2017; all other options are clearly wrong companies."}'::jsonb),
